url: "https://github.com/contrastive-dta/contrastive-dta"
doi: "[Zenodo DOI to be added]"
abstract: |
  Complete reproducibility package for our systematic empirical benchmark of contrastive
  learning (CL) for drug-target affinity (DTA) prediction. Includes 300+ training runs
  across 5 dimensions, 115-directory audit with config-level verification, Holm-corrected
  statistical analysis, an authoritative n=10 KIBA scan (monotonic dose-response,
  +42.74% at α=0.1, Holm p=0.001), and α-dependent cold-target vulnerability analysis.
